@base = http://localhost:3000
@amanha = {{$localDatetime "YYYY-MM-DD" 1 d}}
@ontem = {{$localDatetime "YYYY-MM-DD" -1 d}}
@anoAmanha = {{$localDatetime "YYYY" 1 d}}
@mesAmanha = {{$localDatetime "M" 1 d}}

### Login funcionário
# @name func
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "usuario": "joao.silva", "senha": "NovaSenha@123" }

### Login gerente
# @name gerente
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "usuario": "admin", "senha": "Admin@123" }

### 1. Agenda de amanhã → 10 horários livres (vagas: 1)
GET {{base}}/agendamentos/agenda?data={{amanha}}
Authorization: Bearer {{func.response.body.token}}

### 2. Agendar Thor amanhã às 9h → 201
# @name ag1
POST {{base}}/agendamentos
Authorization: Bearer {{func.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "petId": 1, "data": "{{amanha}}", "hora": 9, "servico": "BANHO" }

### 3. Mel no mesmo horário → 409 (lotado)
POST {{base}}/agendamentos
Authorization: Bearer {{func.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "petId": 2, "data": "{{amanha}}", "hora": 9, "servico": "TOSA" }

### 4. Agendar ontem → 400 (passado)
POST {{base}}/agendamentos
Authorization: Bearer {{func.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "petId": 2, "data": "{{ontem}}", "hora": 10, "servico": "BANHO" }

### 5. Fora do expediente (18h) → 400
POST {{base}}/agendamentos
Authorization: Bearer {{func.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "petId": 2, "data": "{{amanha}}", "hora": 18, "servico": "BANHO" }

### 6. Data que não existe → 400
POST {{base}}/agendamentos
Authorization: Bearer {{func.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "petId": 2, "data": "2027-02-30", "hora": 10, "servico": "BANHO" }

### 7. Pet inexistente → 404
POST {{base}}/agendamentos
Authorization: Bearer {{func.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "petId": 9999, "data": "{{amanha}}", "hora": 10, "servico": "BANHO" }

### 8. Agenda de amanhã → 9h com o Thor, vagas: 0
GET {{base}}/agendamentos/agenda?data={{amanha}}
Authorization: Bearer {{func.response.body.token}}

### 9. Resumo do mês → amanhã com total 1
GET {{base}}/agendamentos/mes?ano={{anoAmanha}}&mes={{mesAmanha}}
Authorization: Bearer {{func.response.body.token}}

### 10. Remarcar Thor para as 10h → 200
PATCH {{base}}/agendamentos/{{ag1.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{func.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "hora": 10 }

### 11. Pular de AGENDADO para CONCLUIDO → 400
PATCH {{base}}/agendamentos/{{ag1.response.body.id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{func.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "CONCLUIDO" }

### 12. Iniciar o banho → 200 (EM_ANDAMENTO)
PATCH {{base}}/agendamentos/{{ag1.response.body.id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{func.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "EM_ANDAMENTO" }

### 13. Tentar remarcar depois de iniciado → 400
PATCH {{base}}/agendamentos/{{ag1.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{func.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "hora": 11 }

### 14. Concluir → 200 (CONCLUIDO)
PATCH {{base}}/agendamentos/{{ag1.response.body.id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{func.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "CONCLUIDO" }

### 15. Agendar Mel amanhã às 11h → 201
# @name ag2
POST {{base}}/agendamentos
Authorization: Bearer {{func.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "petId": 2, "data": "{{amanha}}", "hora": 11, "servico": "TOSA" }

### 16. Cancelar a Mel → 200 (CANCELADO)
PATCH {{base}}/agendamentos/{{ag2.response.body.id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{func.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "CANCELADO" }

### 17. Luna às 11h → 201 (o cancelamento liberou o horário)
POST {{base}}/agendamentos
Authorization: Bearer {{func.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "petId": 3, "data": "{{amanha}}", "hora": 11, "servico": "BANHO" }

### 18. Histórico do Thor → 1 agendamento CONCLUIDO
GET {{base}}/agendamentos/pet/1
Authorization: Bearer {{func.response.body.token}}

### 19. Gerente tenta excluir o Thor → 409 (tem histórico)
DELETE {{base}}/pets/1
Authorization: Bearer {{gerente.response.body.token}}